(rectangle (start 177.8 35.56) (end 295.91 123.19) (stroke (width 0) (type dash)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "1f9eaf67-8080-5c42-8383-eccba26c1227"))
(text "Off-state pull-downs and input pull-ups (PCB-P-18)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 179.07 34.29 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d1fd2eba-e7d4-5f95-ae64-e7243bbe4fcc"))
(text_box "Notes\n1. Function: TCA6416A, the slow enables and detects (pinout v1 expander table); VCCI on\n   vcca1v8_pmu, VCCP on vcc3v3_sys; outputs hold through suspend.\n2. Absent state: never omitted. At power-up every port is an input: P02-P05 pulled down here;\n   P00 on blk.fp-connector, P01 on blk.hat-5v, P06, P07 on blk.radio.\n3. ADDR to VCCP: address 0x21 (SCPS194F). RESET 10 kΩ to VCCI (not driven by the SoC).\n4. Input pull-ups to VCCP: jack detects (HP_DET_*, the jack switch pulls low) and the eFuse\n   faults (open drain), 10 kΩ: capture choices." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 275.59 228.6 0) (size 129.54 20.32) (margins 1.905 1.905 1.905 1.905) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0b15ba16-d9d6-517d-a81d-d8e232c271fe"))
(text "Interface" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 22.86 248.92 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b2188401-3cca-5ba9-b552-a86c6535f2f3"))
